## Project skills (`.cursor/skills/`)

`live-binance-verify`, `validate-delivery-path`, `zero-hit-strategy-triage`, `refactor-module`, `supervised-live-session`, `calibration-wave`, `graphify-navigate`

## Hooks (`.cursor/hooks.json`)

- `sessionStart` — v9 context (IDE only; not cloud agents)
- `beforeReadFile` — deny `.env`, `config.toml`, `data/`
- `beforeShellExecution` + `preToolUse` Shell — guard-shell
- `postToolUse` — verify hints
- `afterFileEdit` — ruff format
- `subagentStop` (de-bloat) — follow-up → verifier
- `stop` — quick offline verify (loop_limit 2)

## Always-on rules (keep lean)

`project-core`, `agent-sole-executor`, `solo-operator` only. Architecture/graphify are agent-decided.

## Claude Code

- Memory: `CLAUDE.md` (<80 lines) · Rules: `.claude/rules/` · Skills: `.claude/skills/` (auto)
- Settings: `.claude/settings.json` (+ Stop → agent_quick_verify.sh)
- Subagents: `.claude/agents/` (mirror of `.cursor/agents/`)
